# Listing placeholder image library

These JPEGs are representative category placeholders. They do not depict the
listed businesses and must not be used to infer a company name, exact location,
property condition, inventory, equipment, brand, or operating condition.

Naming convention:

`bbas-placeholder-{category}-01-{hero|interior|detail}.jpeg`

Current dimensions: 1200 x 900 pixels (4:3).

Use the closest category set for each public listing. Actual business images,
names, addresses, source brochures, and seller documents must remain outside
the public repository until the approved confidential-access process applies.
